                                "sense_id": "a6c400df-5ce2-3e01-8b6f-28ffa72fed5b",
                                "text": "\"Looky thar!\" \"All right, I can see that hole, all right, but the argument was whether the earth was round or flat, and I say it's round!\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e234c4a8-e3ec-4edf-8adc-7886f1a2a88f",
                                "sense_id": "a6c400df-5ce2-3e01-8b6f-28ffa72fed5b",
                                "text": "The old man is cackling. \"Looky here, looky here.\" He's got four little bright coins on his outstretched trembling hand."
                            }
